    <p>infringe anyone else's <em>Intellectual Property Right</em> using <em>Coveralls</em></p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>violate anyone else's rights using <em>Coveralls</em></p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>breach any agreement using <em>Coveralls</em></p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>break the law using <em>Coveralls</em></p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>reverse engineer <em>Coveralls</em></p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>circumvent any access controls or other limits of <em>Coveralls</em></p>
  </li>
  <li>
